            "text": "ephemeral: Terraform will now use and display diagnostics raised when _renewing_ an ephemeral resource. This may cause warnings to appear that previously were lost. We expect that any error diagnostics that were previously lost would have caused confusing downstream errors, so we do not anticipate this change to be breaking. ([#38989](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/38989))",
